Spec pass criteria (docs/design/NEARS-3936-group-fee-failure-row-spec.md Surface 1 s3 + RTL/a11y): "no mid-word break ... store name stays readable (2 lines, ellipsis on a 3rd). Fail on either locale -> this layout does not clear the floor" -> conditional fallback + advisor-product re-show.
Cause (read, not changed): checkout_group_fee_breakdown.dart _unresolvedLine -> store name is Expanded(flex: 2) vs the Flexible(flex: 3) error/Retry Wrap, leaving ~2/5 of the row for the name; "supermarket" at bodyMd x1.3 exceeds that width, so Text breaks inside the word.
